  {
   "id": "EDERadioConversation",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Uh... Hello? Hi. Are you there? Oh, right. You can't respond.{Pause} Listen, I'm using your robot as a relay to get this message to you.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "I've picked up some unusual chatter regarding your robot. It seems that it has some information that we could use. Oh wait, where are my manners?",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "This is Lorenzo, a Knight with the Brotherhood of Steel. We'd be very interested in examining your tech.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Whenever you get a chance, can you bring your robot back to Hidden Valley so I can take a look at it?",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Hi, sorry to break in, he sounded truly riveting. I don't want to keep you much longer, but I'd like to make a counter suggestion.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "I'm with the Followers of the Apocalypse. We are much more liberal about the sharing of technology than those Brotherhood...{pause} People.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Bring your robot to us, we'll see that whatever information it may have on it is used for the greater good.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "EDERadioConversation"
  },
