  {
   "id": "VEndingEdE",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "{Narrating - ED-E Dies}After a long and fantastic journey, ED-E finally met its end with the dangers of the Mojave.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "It lay destroyed and gathering dust, waiting for scavengers to pick through its remains for salvage.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "{Narrating ED-E Unrepaired}ED-E remained forgotten in the shop of Johnson Nash, until it was repaired by another courier who let it continue on its journey to Navarro.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "ED-E was eventually discovered by the Followers of the Apocalypse who managed to recover vast databanks of scientific knowledge.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "{Narrating ED-E Found/unresolved}ED-E traveled with the Courier until one of its memory banks was triggered causing it to continue its travels on to Navarro.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Upon reaching Navarro ED-E vanished and was not see in the wastes again.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "{Narrating ED-E Resolved With Followers - Not dismissed}With its logs cleared and its systems upgraded ED-E remained a vigilant and constant companion to the courier.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "The Followers of the Apocalypse used the information recovered from ED-E on Poseidon Energy, to develop new methods to harness the energy of the sun.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "{Narrating ED-E Resolved With Brotherhood- Not dismissed}With its logs cleared and its systems upgraded ED-E remained a vigilant and constant companion to the courier.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "The Brotherhood used the information recovered from ED-E to create a small army of Duraframe Eyebots.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
